defect def:external-events-constant-collision
  status OPEN
  verification REPRODUCED
  target external_events.py
  symptom EE.EXTERNAL_STATE_CHANGE = "external_state_change" is a LEDGER_CATEGORIES value and is NOT in EVENT_KINDS; the valid kind is EE.STATE_CHANGED = "state_changed"
  effect observe() raises "unknown event_kind 'external_state_change'" for the constant whose name most reads like the right one
  fix_shape rename the ledger category, or reject at import time when a category and a kind share a stem

claim clm:sonar-token-expired
  status UNRESOLVED
  verification REPRODUCED
  finding SONAR_TOKEN in u90.env is dead -- /api/authentication/validate returns {"valid":false} and the issues endpoint returns HTTP 401
  note SONAR_URL is also stored as a full endpoint rather than a base, so any consumer must strip the path
  contrast AZURE_DEVOPS_EXT_PAT in the same file is live and returned 4 projects
  action_required rotate or reissue the Sonar token; Upper90 code-quality data is currently unreachable
